user entries: 19
  counted as REAL user turns (span boundaries): 5
  excluded as isMeta: 2
    isMeta:true -- a prompt the engine synthesised, e.g. the relaunch stub "Continue
    from where you left off."
  excluded as tool_result: 12
    carries tool_result blocks only -- the engine handing a tool's output back, which is
    the overwhelming majority of user entries in a real transcript
  excluded as engine_injected: 0
    promptSource names the engine itself (e.g. a <task-notification> injected when a
    background task ends), with no isMeta to mark it
  unaccounted for (must be 0): 0

